### Test 1: Save Model - New model
POST {{baseUrl}}/Vehicle/saveModel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "makerId": 45,
  "modelName": "Aumark S"
}

### Test 2: Save Model - Existing model (idempotent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Vehicle/saveModel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "makerId": 45,
  "modelName": "aumark s"
}

### Test 3: Save Model - Invalid (maker does not exist)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Vehicle/saveModel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "makerId": 999999,
  "modelName": "X"
}
